{"id":"H2650","lemma":"חֻפִּים","transliteration":"chuppim","sayIt":"chup-pim","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Huppim","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1Ch.7.12;\nson of: Ir (H5893);\nbrother of: Shuppim (H8206) and Maacah (H4601M)\n§ Huppim = \"protected\"\nthe head of a Benjamite family","glosses":["huppim","huppites","among the huppites"],"count":3,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-46","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"Huppim","kjv":"and Huppim"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Huppites","kjv":"and Huppim"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"from among the Huppites","kjv":"the sister of Huppim"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 46:21","note":"The sons of Benjamin: Bela, Becher, Ashbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Rosh, Muppim, Huppim, and Ard.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:12","note":"So were Shuppim, Huppim, the sons of Ir, Hushim, and the sons of Aher.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0278","lemma":"אֵחִי","transliteration":"echi","gloss":"Ehi"},{"id":"H0297","lemma":"אֲחִירָם","transliteration":"achiram","gloss":"Ahiram"},{"id":"H0714","lemma":"אַרְדְּ","transliteration":"ard","gloss":"Ard"},{"id":"H0788","lemma":"אַשְׁבֵּל","transliteration":"ashbel","gloss":"Ashbel"},{"id":"H1071","lemma":"בֶּ֫כֶר","transliteration":"bekher","gloss":"Becher"},{"id":"H1106","lemma":"בֶּ֫לַע","transliteration":"bela","gloss":"Bela"},{"id":"H1144","lemma":"בִּנְיָמִין","transliteration":"binyamin","gloss":"Benjamin"},{"id":"H1617","lemma":"גֵּרָא","transliteration":"gera","gloss":"Gera"}],"senses":[{"id":"H2650H","gloss":"Huppim","relation":"H2650H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}